    "text": "My Ref No.: NIDS/LND05/ACQ70. Land Ministry Ref. No.: 4-3/2/2014/HA/200. I, hereby give notice under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the land Acquisition Act, as Amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964 that the Government intends to acquire the following land/servitude* which is required for a public purpose.",
