    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land/Lands* on which a servitude is to be acquired are herby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at Gampaha Divisional Secretariat on the 28th August day of 2019 at 2.00 p. m. and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 21st August 2019 the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land/servitude*, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
